{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_11_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，滕侯、薛侯來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_11_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"天子無事，諸侯相朝，正也。考禮脩德，所以尊天子也。諸侯來朝，時正也。犆言，同時也。累數，皆至也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_11_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，公會鄭伯於時來。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_11_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，壬午，公及齊侯、鄭伯入許。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_11_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有一月，壬辰，公薨。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_11_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_11","textTraditional":"公薨不地，故也。隱之，不忍地也。其不言葬何也？君弒賊不討，不書葬，以罪下也。隱十年無正，隱不自正也。元年有正，所以正隱也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}